# BUGS

Only sRGB with BT.709's primaries is blended: other transfers and primaries have no tables.
The encode isn't dithered, so a slow gradient can band.
The contrast curve's direction is chosen pixel by pixel from what is beneath, so text over a pattern of light and dark changes weight with it.
